{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 16, "ref": "genesis 42:16", "book": "genesis", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 42, "translation": "Hantarlah seorang dari antara ⟨את⟩ kamu supaya dia mengambil ⟨את⟩ saudara kamu, dan kamu, berkuncilah kamu, supaya kata-kata kamu diuji, ⟨adakah⟩ kebenaran bersama kamu; dan jika tidak — demi nyawa Paroh, sesungguhnya pengintip kamu!", "tokens": [{"surface": "שלחו", "gloss": "Hantarlah"}, {"surface": "מכם", "gloss": "dari antara kamu"}, {"surface": "אחד", "gloss": "seorang"}, {"surface": "ויקח", "gloss": "supaya dia mengambil"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "saudara kamu"}, {"surface": "אחיכם", "gloss": "saudara kamu"}, {"surface": "ואתם", "gloss": "dan kamu"}, {"surface": "האסרו", "gloss": "berkuncilah kamu"}, {"surface": "ויבחנו", "gloss": "supaya diuji"}, {"surface": "דבריכם", "gloss": "kata-kata kamu"}, {"surface": "האמת", "gloss": "kebenaran"}, {"surface": "אתכם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ kamu"}, {"surface": "ואם", "gloss": "dan jika"}, {"surface": "לא", "gloss": "tidak"}, {"surface": "חי", "gloss": "demi nyawa"}, {"surface": "פרעה", "gloss": "Paroh"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "sesungguhnya"}, {"surface": "מרגלים", "gloss": "pengintip"}, {"surface": "אתם", "gloss": "kamu"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T11:09:24.835522734Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}